  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Displacement Tracking and Evidence for Migration Analysis and Policy in Asia (DATA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Objective of the Action is to increase the effectiveness of humanitarian and development efforts on migration and displacement in Afghanistan, Bangladesh, Kazakhstan, Kyrgyzstan, Pakistan, Tajikistan and Uzbekistan. The Specific Objectives (Outcomes) of this Action are to: Specific Objective 1 (SO1): Improved and sustainable policies on migration, displacement and return in the target countries, including from a gender perspective Specific Objective 2 (SO2): Enhanced regional interoperability and harmonisation of migration and displacement data collection initiatives Specific Objective 3 (SO3): Improved generation, utilization and management of migration and displacement data by relevant government institutions in Bangladesh, Central Asia, and Pakistan.</narrative>
  </description>
